  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Does this have anything to do with type universes?</html:p>
    <html:p>In analogy, one of the issues with implementing universe
polymorphic code is that abstracting over a level lifts to
Type<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\omega ]]></fr:tex>. Is this issue related to modules and functors here the
same sort of thing?</html:p>
    <html:p>This seems very related to Paulette's talk on using type universes
for memory layouts.</html:p>
